msgid ""
"Every server block of the selected items uses the choice below. Locations "
"with their own setting keep it. Each file is tested and Nginx reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Chaque bloc serveur des éléments sélectionnés utilise le choix ci-dessous. "
"Les emplacements ayant leur propre paramètre le conservent. Chaque fichier "
"est testé et Nginx est rechargé."

