"Nginx UI reads configuration and logs entirely over SSH and SFTP. No host "
"directories are mounted into the container."
msgstr ""
"Nginx UI lit entièrement la configuration et les journaux via SSH et SFTP. "
"Aucun répertoire de l’hôte n’est monté dans le conteneur."

